OL,3,GNEWSAChildren-in-care costs lead to
OL,4,Apredicted overspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe "unprecedented demand" on funding
OL,7,Ffor children in care with complex needs
OL,8,Fhas led to forecast overspends in a
OL,9,Fnumber of areas at Lincolnshire County
OL,10,FCouncil, a senior officer has said.
OL,12,FA report to the council's audit
OL,13,Fcommittee said the "growing complexity
OL,14,Fof need" for children in care had
OL,15,Fcontributed to an overspend in the
OL,16,Fbudget.
OL,18,FAccording to the Local Democracy
OL,19,FReporting Service, the heightened
OL,20,Fdemand resulted in a forecast overspend
OL,21,Fof #12.6m between April and June this
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
