OL,3,GNEWSAChildren-in-care costs lead to
OL,4,Apredicted overspend
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a committee meeting on Monday, Pam
OL,7,FClipson, the council's head of
OL,8,Ffinancial services, said costs were
OL,9,F"playing out in a number of areas"
OL,10,Fincluding home-schooling and transport,
OL,11,F"particularly in the SEND area".
